    "message": "fix(clang-tidy): justify external linkage in compiler warnings fixture (#1295)\n\nResolves the 14 remaining `misc-use-internal-linkage` alerts, all in\n`quality/compiler_warnings/test/no_warnings/clean.cpp`, with a justified\n`NOLINTBEGIN/END`.\n\nThe file is a compile-only false-positive fixture whose helpers are\nintentionally unused. Moving them to an anonymous namespace would\ntrigger `-Wunused-function`, the very warning the fixture asserts is\nabsent (and would fail with `-Werror`). Keeping external linkage\npreserves the test's meaning.",
